{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/f00c843e9dc365f35abb72970d82219c.avif?t=1756459677\" width=640 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/b7790cf74f1419a15fd209ec2c2ed6fe.poster.avif?t=1756459677\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/b7790cf74f1419a15fd209ec2c2ed6fe.webm?t=1756459677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match matters; your remaining moves carry over from one floor to the next, so efficiency is key. Dig through the rock to uncover ores and rare materials, while fending off bizarre subterranean creatures that crawl, slither, and sneak across the board. Some block your matches, others eat your precious minerals, forcing you to adapt your strategy on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/edeefec0470a501c8daba5f5391d7c16.avif?t=1756459677\" width=640 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/3d822af328ad3a5c2ea6e0a045e8c0ca.poster.avif?t=1756459677\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/3d822af328ad3a5c2ea6e0a045e8c0ca.webm?t=1756459677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haul your resources back to town and restore the long-forgotten mining tower. Each repair breathes life into the ruins and unlocks new opportunities. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet the town\u2019s unsettling residents, people with strange requests, questionable trades, and a lingering air of mystery. Fulfilling their demands might reward you\u2026 or come back to haunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/085fde57d7de5e0aeac29d094c037378.avif?t=1756459677\" width=640 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/047a29afe597d5480c50a822304f475a.poster.avif?t=1756459677\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/047a29afe597d5480c50a822304f475a.webm?t=1756459677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilding grants you new tools, artifacts, and special abilities that reshape each run. Piece them together into the perfect, overpowered build, one that smashes through tougher rock, clears enemies in style, and turns every move into a devastating chain reaction. With every upgrade, you can push further down, reaching deeper floors where rarer and more powerful resources await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/0cf0b35eb951051220c51c7759536caa.avif?t=1756459677\" width=640 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/83534a60c8dbff359e9c519b5cfcc894.poster.avif?t=1756459677\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/83534a60c8dbff359e9c519b5cfcc894.webm?t=1756459677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers keep muttering about something waiting at the bottom of the mine. Every floor draws you closer, and once you cross that final threshold, there\u2019s no turning back. Some treasures are worth the risk. Others will end your run forever.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930130?t=1756459677","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/3c8984618c5b6f022a495c780ca7ccf0329fb0e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756459677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/028e91d11480add0ddd02f7f69ccd41b634a51d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756459677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/028e91d11480add0ddd02f7f69ccd41b634a51d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756459677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930130/extras/f00c843e9dc365f35abb72970d82219c.avif?t=1756459677\" width=640 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat